<SubPage title="Music" heading="Music" background="#7A4FBF">
  <div class="intro">
    <p>When I was 12 and I first made this website, I added a footnote about how I 'did some music'. It linked to nothing; I thought it wasn't important, and it wouldn't help make the world a better place any more than my coding skills.</p>
    <p>4 years later, music is now one of the most important parts of my life. I am a composer and performer, playing the piano, drums, guitar, saxophone, and singing.</p>
    <p>Here is a collection of the many musical milestones I believe are worth sharing. They may or may not have made the world a better place. Enjoy.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="links">
    <a class="btn" href="https://musescore.com/user/55755611" target="_blank" rel="noopener">My MuseScore</a>
  </div>
</SubPage>

